# vt is a terminal emulator that runs rc. The script runs echo in it. The sixth item of the menu of button 3, exit, stops it. The menu opens with the first item under the mouse, and each item is 18 pixels high, so the drag goes down 90 pixels. The command exit of rc does not do, because the console session of the machine gives rc a function exit that halts the file system.
class exact
window 500x300
run vt
quiet
snap open
keys "echo hello\n"
quiet
snap echo
drag 3 250,100 250,190
exit none
